\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par  \cf0 1.  It is blessed for humankind
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 To avoid paths of the sinful,
\par And from their counsel stay away,
\par The acts of scoffers to detest.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2. To follow the laws of the Lord,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 To joyfully deliberate,
\par Each day at morn and in the night
\par To follow and with zeal adapt.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  They may be likened to a tree
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 On the bank of a great river
\par And giveth fruits in multiples
\par Within all seasons of the year.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  They never, ever shed their leaves,
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 And it is always well with them,
\par From day to day they juvenate,
\par Truly, such person is so blessed
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

